      <!-- Interior lighting: ceiling blocks the world's directional sun,
           so the arena is lit by a 3x2 grid of point lights below the slab.
           Lights must be children of <link>; model-scope <light> is not
           valid in SDF 1.8 and is silently dropped by the parser. -->
